  <activityDataset>
    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="eba5767f-d539-515d-a0b0-725244ee0dea" activityNameId="a5182138-9f2b-522a-81ca-5d4bd43f7b2c" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Diesel, burned in cogen 50kWth</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Diesel, burned in cogen 50kWth
Inventory for 1 MJ diesel, burned in a cogeneration plant with a capacity of 50 kWth. This inventory reflects the unallocated process of burning diesel in a cogen unit with all necessary inputs and emissions. Efficiency of the cogen unit as well allocation is not yet considered;
UUID: 759bb964-ed3d-3352-a093-6e6bf84ba2ca
The module includes fuel input from (CH) network, infrastructure (cogeneration plant), emissions to air and water, and electricity needed for operation.
Location: Data apply to the combustion in Switzerland.
Technology: Average technology available on the market
Time period: Time of publications.
Production volume: na
Sampling: based on literature 
Extrapolations: Infrastructure extrapolated from 200kWel cogen unit. Some emissions are extrapolated from light fuel oil, burned in boiler &lt;100KW
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_759bb964-ed3d-3352-a093-6e6bf84ba2ca.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
